    data:WriteULong(1134) -- Faction ID (Darkmoon Faire)
    data:WriteULong(42000) -- Reputation value
    player:SendPacket(data)
end
```

**Yellow effect (100% level up):**
- Normal game behavior
- Server sends level-up packet automatically
- No custom packet needed

### Configuration

**worldserver.conf:**
```
Rate.Talent = 1        # 1 point at level-up (Lua adds 2 more)
MaxPlayerLevel = 20    # Cap at 20
```

